   "RoleTowerStageDesc_12": "[Recommended]: <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter</color>\nA successful Dodge or Counterattack pauses the timer for {0}s.\nA successful Dodge pauses the timer for an additional {1}s.\nWhen Crownless takes DMG in mid-air, the timer pauses for {2}s and Crownless gains Unbalanced. Each stack makes Crownless take {3} more total DMG. Crownless can gain <SapTag=5>{5}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=5} of Unbalanced every {4}s, stacking up to {6} times. While on the ground, Crownless loses <SapTag=8>{8}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=8} of Unbalanced every {7}s.",
   "RoleTowerStageDesc_13": "[Recommended]: <color=Highlight>Immobilization</color>\nTriggering Dodge Counter or Counterattack pauses the timer for {0}s.\nEach time an enemy becomes immobilized, the timer pauses for {1}s.\nAn enemy's ATK is increased by {2} while it has a Shield.\nEach time an enemy takes DMG, its ATK is increased by {3}, up to {4}. When the enemy is hit by a Counterattack or becomes immobilized, this ATK increase is converted into a DEF reduction.",
   "RoleTowerStageDesc_14": "[Recommended]: <color=Highlight>Shield</color> or <color=Highlight>Counterattack</color>\nA successful Dodge or Counterattack pauses the timer for {0}s.\nEach Counterattack pauses the timer for an additional {1}s.\nWhen an enemy hits a Resonator with a Shield or is hit by a Counterattack, its ATK is reduced by {2} for {3}s. Enemy attacks inflict Fusion Burst on Resonators on hit. This effect deals massive DMG upon detonation, which will be greatly reduced if the Resonator has a Shield.",
-  "RoleTowerStageDesc_15": "[Recommended]: <color=Highlight>Immobilization</color> or <color=Highlight>Counterattack</color>\nA successful Dodge or Counterattack pauses the timer for {0}s.\nEach time an enemy becomes immobilized, the timer pauses for {1}s.\nThe enemy starts with <SapTag=2>{2}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=2} of Dreamborne Shell. Each stack increases its ATK by {3} and DEF by {4}. At {5} stacks of Dreamborne Shell, the enemy becomes immobilized. While immobilized, it takes {6} more DMG.\nWhen a Resonator successfully dodges, the enemy loses <SapTag=7>{7}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=7} of Dreamborne Shell. When the enemy deals DMG, its Dreamborne Shell count resets to <SapTag=8>{8}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=8}. When immobilization ends, the enemy regains <SapTag=9>{9}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=9} of Dreamborne Shell.",
+  "RoleTowerStageDesc_15": "[Recommended]: <color=Highlight>Immobilization</color> or <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter</color>\nA successful Dodge or Counterattack pauses the timer for {0}s.\nEach time an enemy becomes immobilized, the timer pauses for {1}s.\nThe enemy starts with <SapTag=2>{2}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=2} of Dreamborne Shell. Each stack increases its ATK by {3} and DEF by {4}. At {5} stacks of Dreamborne Shell, the enemy becomes immobilized. While immobilized, it takes {6} more DMG.\nWhen a Resonator successfully dodges, the enemy loses <SapTag=7>{7}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=7} of Dreamborne Shell. When the enemy deals DMG, its Dreamborne Shell count resets to <SapTag=8>{8}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=8}. When immobilization ends, the enemy regains <SapTag=9>{9}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=9} of Dreamborne Shell.",
   "RoleTowerStageDesc_2": "[Recommended]: <color=Highlight>Traction</color>\nTriggering Dodge Counter or Counterattack pauses the timer for {0}s.\nDealing DMG triggers an explosion, dealing DMG to the target and nearby enemies. This effect can be triggered up to <SapTag=2>{2}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=time P=times SapTag=2} on each target within {1}s.",
   "RoleTowerStageDesc_3": "[Recommended]: <color=Highlight>Counterattack</color>\nA successful Dodge or Counterattack pauses the timer for {0}s.\nBranch 1: Each Counterattack pauses the timer for an additional {1}s.\nBranch 2: Each Counterattack pauses the timer for an additional {2}s. The enemy boss is greatly enhanced. Defeating it adds {3}s to the remaining time.",
   "RoleTowerStageDesc_4": "[Recommended]: <color=Highlight>Traction</color> or <color=Highlight>Counterattack</color>\nA successful Dodge or Counterattack pauses the timer for {0}s.\nBranch 1: Dealing DMG triggers an explosion, dealing DMG to the target and nearby enemies. This effect can be triggered up to <SapTag=2>{2}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=time P=times SapTag=2} on each target within {1}s.\nBranch 2: Each Counterattack pauses the timer for an additional {3}s. The enemy boss is greatly enhanced. This enhancement is disabled while the boss is immobilized. Immobilizing the boss adds {4}s to the remaining time.",
