   "Skill_1006302_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Nightmare Blend</color></size>\nLily starts with <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> by default. When <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Resonance Skill to deal <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to nearby targets, then switch to <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>.\nThis skill shares a Cooldown with <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Reverie Blend</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Reverie Blend</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Resonance Skill to deal <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to nearby targets, then switch to <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color>.\nThis skill shares a Cooldown with <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Nightmare Blend</color>.",
   "Skill_1006302_SkillName": "Dream Blend",
   "Skill_1006302_SkillResume": "<size=40><color=Title>Nightmare Blend</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Resonance Skill to switch to <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Reverie Blend</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} Resonance Skill to switch to <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color>, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.",
-  "Skill_1006303_SkillDescribe": "Casting this skill sends Lily into <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> and grants <color=Highlight><te href=151203>Cradle Lullaby</te></color> to Resonators in the team.\nCasting this skill also grants Lily a Shield equal to 100% of her Max HP for 4s. This Shield does not carry over to the incoming Resonator.\nCan be cast in mid-air close to the ground.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Slumber</color></size>\nLasts for 50s. When Lily is in <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color>, she heals the nearby active Resonator every 3s. During <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color>, use directional input to command <color=Highlight>Dreambind</color> to deal <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to nearby targets. <color=Highlight>Dreambind</color> pulls in targets within a certain range every 5s, and stops attacking 10s after movement stops. {Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} Resonance Liberation again during <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> to end it early.\nWhen Lily is in <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color>, when a Resonator in the team casts <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color>, targets within a certain range are pulled in, triggered once every 10s. Lily is immune to interruption during <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> and takes 50% less DMG.\nSwitching to another Resonator during <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> keeps Lily on the field. Lily leaves the field when <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> ends, or earlier if she gets too far from the active Resonator.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Cradle Lullaby</color></size>\nLasts for 25s. While this effect is active, each <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> cast by a Resonator in the team grants 1 stack of <color=Highlight><te href=151204>Dream Aroma</te></color>. This effect is removed when Lily is the incoming Resonator.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Dream Aroma</color></size>\nStacks up to 4 times. Each stack increases the ATK of all Resonators on the team by 0.1% for every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen above 190%, up to 7%. This effect is removed when Lily is the incoming Resonator or when <color=Highlight>Cradle Lullaby</color> ends.",
+  "Skill_1006303_SkillDescribe": "Casting this skill sends Lily into <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> and grants her <color=Highlight><te href=151203>Cradle Lullaby</te></color>.\nCasting this skill also grants Lily a Shield equal to 100% of her Max HP for 4s. This Shield does not carry over to the incoming Resonator.\nCan be cast in mid-air close to the ground.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Slumberland</color></size>\nLasts for 50s. When Lily is in <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color>, she heals the nearby active Resonator every 3s. During <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color>, use directional input to command <color=Highlight>Dreambind</color> to deal <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to nearby targets. <color=Highlight>Dreambind</color> pulls in targets within a certain range every 5s, and stops attacking 10s after movement stops. {Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} Resonance Liberation again during <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> to end it early.\nWhen Lily is in <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> and a Resonator in the team other than Lily casts <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color>, targets within a certain range are pulled in. This effect can be triggered once every 10s. Lily is immune to interruption during <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> and takes 50% less DMG.\nSwitching to another Resonator during <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> keeps Lily on the field but stops the attacks of <color=Highlight>Dreambind</color>. Lily leaves the field when <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> ends, or earlier if she gets too far from the active Resonator. Casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Eternal Bloom</color> also ends <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> immediately.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Cradle Lullaby</color></size>\nLasts for 25s. While this effect is active, each <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> cast by a Resonator in the team other than Lily grants 1 stack of <color=Highlight><te href=151204>Dream Aroma</te></color>. <color=Highlight>Cradle Lullaby</color> is removed when Lily is the incoming Resonator.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Dream Aroma</color></size>\nStacks up to 4 times. Each stack increases the ATK of all Resonators in the team by 0.1% for every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 190%, up to 7%. This effect is removed when Lily is the incoming Resonator or when <color=Highlight>Cradle Lullaby</color> ends.",
   "Skill_1006303_SkillName": "Into the Dream Cradle",
   "Skill_1006303_SkillResume": "Casting this skill sends Lily into <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color> and grants <color=Highlight>Cradle Lullaby</color> to all Resonators in the team.\nCasting this skill also grants a Shield.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Slumberland</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color>, Lily continuously heals the active Resonator.\nDuring <color=Highlight>Slumberland</color>, when a Resonator in the team casts <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color>, targets within a certain range are pulled in.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Cradle Lullaby</color></size>\nWhile this effect is active, when the active Resonator casts <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color>, the ATK of all Resonators in the team is increased. This effect is removed when Lily is the incoming Resonator.",
   "Skill_1006304_SkillDescribe": "Casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Eternal Bloom</color> additionally restores 10 points of Concerto Energy, triggered once every 20s.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> additionally restores 15 points of Concerto Energy, triggered once every 20s.",
   "Skill_1006304_SkillName": "Woven Scent",
   "Skill_1006304_SkillResume": "Casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Eternal Bloom</color> additionally restores Concerto Energy.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> additionally restores Concerto Energy.",
-  "Skill_1006305_SkillDescribe": "While the active Resonator has 50% or more HP, Lily grants them 10% DMG Reduction.\nWhen a Resonator in the team takes a fatal blow, they will not be downed and will instead gain a Shield equal to 10% of Lily's Max HP for 10s. This effect can be triggered once every 5 min.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> grants <color=Highlight>Floral Blessing</color> to all Resonators in the team.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Floral Blessing</color></size>\nLasts for 60s. When a Resonator in the team takes DMG that brings their HP below 50% of their Max HP, they restore HP equal to 50% of their Max HP, and <color=Highlight>Floral Blessing</color> is removed. This effect can be triggered once every 120s.",
+  "Skill_1006305_SkillDescribe": "While a nearby active Resonator has 50% or more HP, Lily grants them 10% DMG Reduction.\nWhen a Resonator in the team takes a fatal blow, they will not fall and will instead gain a Shield equal to 10% of Lily's Max HP for 10s. This effect can be triggered once every 5 min.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Enhanced Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> or <color=Highlight>Enhanced Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> grants <color=Highlight>Floral Blessing</color> to Resonators in the team.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Floral Blessing</color></size>\nLasts for 60s. When the HP of a Resonator in the team is below 50% of their Max HP, restore 50% of their Max HP and remove <color=Highlight>Floral Blessing</color>. This effect can be triggered once every 120s.",
   "Skill_1006305_SkillName": "Flowers for You",
-  "Skill_1006305_SkillResume": "While the active Resonator has high HP, Lily grants them DMG Reduction.\nWhen a Resonator in the team takes a fatal blow, they will not be downed and will instead gain a Shield.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> grants <color=Highlight>Floral Blessing</color> to Resonators in the team.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Floral Blessing</color></size>\nWhen a Resonator in the team takes DMG and drops to very low HP, restore their HP.",
-  "Skill_1006306_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>First Bloom</color></size>\nAttack the target, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>. {Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to cast Basic Attack Stage 3.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Eternal Bloom</color></size>\nAfter casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Into the Dream Cradle</color>, Lily's next Intro Skill <color=Highlight>First Bloom</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Eternal Bloom</color>. When cast, it attacks the target, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nFor every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 100%, this skill gains an additional 0.5% Crit. Rate, up to 80%, and an additional 1% Crit. DMG, up to 160%.\nCasting the skill grants <color=Highlight>Deep Dream Fragrance</color> for 8s. Casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> consumes <color=Highlight>Deep Dream Fragrance</color> to additionally grant 100 points of <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color>.\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to cast Basic Attack Stage 3.",
+  "Skill_1006305_SkillResume": "While the active Resonator has high HP, Lily grants them DMG Reduction.\nWhen a Resonator in the team takes a fatal blow, they will not be downed and will instead gain a Shield.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> grants Lily <color=Highlight>Floral Blessing</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Floral Blessing</color></size>\nWhen a Resonator in the team has low HP, restore their HP.",
+  "Skill_1006306_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>First Bloom</color></size>\nAttack the target, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>. {Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to cast Basic Attack Stage 3.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Eternal Bloom</color></size>\nAfter casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Into the Dream Cradle</color>, Lily's next Intro Skill <color=Highlight>First Bloom</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Eternal Bloom</color>. When cast, it attacks the target, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nFor every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 100%, this skill gains 0.5% Crit. Rate, up to 80%, and 1% Crit. DMG, up to 160%.\nCasting the skill grants <color=Highlight>Deep Dream Fragrance</color> for 8s. Casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> consumes <color=Highlight>Deep Dream Fragrance</color> to additionally grant 100 points of <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color>.\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to cast Basic Attack Stage 3.",
   "Skill_1006306_SkillName": "Blooming Dream",
   "Skill_1006306_SkillResume": "<size=40><color=Title>First Bloom</color></size>\nAttack the target, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Eternal Bloom</color></size>\nWhile <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Into the Dream Cradle</color> is active, Lily's Intro Skill <color=Highlight>First Bloom</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Eternal Bloom</color>. When cast, it attacks the target, dealing greater <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nAfter the skill is cast, casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> additionally grants 100 points of <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color>.",
-  "Skill_1006307_MultiSkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Dream Perfume</color></size>\nLily can hold up to 300 points.\n<color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color>, <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack</color>, and <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter</color> restore <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> on hit.\nAfter casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Reverie Blend</color> or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Nightmare Blend</color>, restore 130 points of <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color>.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Eternal Bloom</color> restores 130 points of <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> is full, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color>, consuming all <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> to grant 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Dream Shelter</color>. During the skill, she pulls in nearby targets and continuously deals <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to them. She also heals all Resonators in the team every second for 2s.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> grants Lily <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color>.\nSwitching to another Resonator during <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> stops the skills immediately.\nLily continuously gains <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> during the skill.\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> reaches 300 points, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to stop the skill immediately and cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color>. <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> is automatically cast at the end of <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color>. Casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> consumes all <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color></size>\nAttack targets within range, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nFor every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 100%, this skill gains an additional 0.5% Crit. Rate, up to 80%, and an additional 1% Crit. DMG, up to 160%.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> is full, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>, consuming all <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> to grant 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Dream Shelter</color>. During the skill, she pulls in nearby targets and continuously deals <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to them. She also heals all Resonators in the team every second for 2s.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> grants Lily <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color>.\nSwitching to another Resonator during <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> stops the skill immediately.\nLily continuously gains <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> during the skill.\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> reaches 300 points, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to stop the skill immediately and cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color>. <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> is automatically cast at the end of <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>. Casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> consumes all <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color></size>\nAttack targets within range, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nFor every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 100%, this skill gains an additional 0.5% Crit. Rate, up to 80%, and an additional 1% Crit. DMG, up to 160%.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Dream Shelter</color></size>\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> grants 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Dream Shelter</color>, stacking up to 1 time. Receiving damage from an enemy target consumes 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Dream Shelter</color> to grant Lily immunity to interruption and reduce the DMG taken by 60% for 1s. This effect can be triggered once every 1s.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Wish of Praying Dream</color></size>\nCan be gained once every 25s.\nWhen Lily has <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color>, this <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> consumes <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color> to increase the skill's healing by 400%.",
-  "Skill_1006307_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Dream Perfume</color></size>\nLily can hold up to 300 points.\n<color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color>, <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack</color>, and <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter</color> restore <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> on hit.\nAfter casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Reverie Blend</color> or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Nightmare Blend</color>, restore 130 points of <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color>.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Eternal Bloom</color> restores 130 points of <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> is full, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color>, consuming all <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> to grant 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Dream Shelter</color>. During the skill, she pulls in nearby targets and continuously deals <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to them. She also heals all Resonators in the team every second for 2s.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> grants Lily <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color>.\nSwitching to another Resonator during <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> stops the skills immediately.\nLily continuously gains <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> during the skill.\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> reaches 300 points, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to stop the skill immediately and cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color>. <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> is automatically cast at the end of <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color>. Casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color> consumes all <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Fairytale's Finale</color></size>\nAttack targets within range, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nFor every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 100%, this skill gains an additional 0.5% Crit. Rate, up to 80%, and an additional 1% Crit. DMG, up to 160%.\nCasting the skill grants Lily <color=Highlight>Sillage</color> for 6s. Casting Outro Skill consumes <color=Highlight>Sillage</color> and grants <color=Highlight><te href=151202>Silvered Dream</te></color> to Resonators in the team. This effect can be triggered once every 20s.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color></size>\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> is full, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>, consuming all <color=Highlight>Dream Perfume</color> to grant 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Dream Shelter</color>. During the skill, she pulls in nearby targets and continuously deals <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color> to them. She also heals all Resonators in the team every second for 2s.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> grants Lily <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color>.\nSwitching to another Resonator during <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> stops the skill immediately.\nLily continuously gains <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> during the skill.\nWhen <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color> reaches 300 points, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to stop the skill immediately and cast <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color>. <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> is automatically cast at the end of <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color>. Casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color> consumes all <color=Highlight>Dreambell Chime</color>.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Heavy Attack - Phantasm's End</color></size>\nAttack targets within range, dealing <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nFor every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen exceeding 100%, this skill gains an additional 0.5% Crit. Rate, up to 80%, and an additional 1% Crit. DMG, up to 160%.\nCasting this skill grants Lily <color=Highlight>Sillage</color> for 6s. Casting Outro Skill consumes <color=Highlight>Sillage</color> and grants <color=Highlight><te href=151202>Silvered Dream</te></color> to Resonators in the team. This effect can be triggered once every 20s.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Silvered Dream</color></size>\nLasts for 30s.\nWhen the Resonator with this effect is the Active Resonator and can trigger Unison Response, each stack of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color> on the team increases their ATK by 0.1% for every 1% of Lily's Energy Regen above 190%, up to 7%, counting up to 4 stacks of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color>.\nThe active Resonator's Echo Skill Crit. Rate and Echo Skill Crit. DMG are increased. Every 0.7% of Lily's Energy Regen above 190% increases Echo Skill Crit. Rate by 0.1%, up to 10%. Every 0.7% of Lily's Energy Regen above 190% increases Echo Skill Crit. DMG by 0.2%, up to 20%.\nAll Resonators in the team gain resistance to interruption.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Dream Shelter</color></size>\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> grants 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Dream Shelter</color>, stacking up to 1 time. Receiving damage from an enemy target consumes 1 stack of <color=Highlight>Dream Shelter</color> to grant Lily immunity to interruption and reduce the DMG taken by 60% for 1s. This effect can be triggered once every 1s.\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>Wish of Praying Dream</color></size>\nCan be gained once every 25s.\nWhen Lily has <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color>, this <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Fairytale</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Woven Phantasm</color> consumes <color=Highlight>Wish of Praying Dream</color> to increase the skill's healing by 400%.",
